                <span style={{ color: '#d32f2f', fontWeight: '600', fontSize: '1rem' }}>Important Note</span>
              </div>
              <p style={{ color: '#d32f2f', margin: 0, fontSize: '0.9rem' }}>
                <strong>Security Deposit:</strong> An additional ₹500 security deposit for electricity usage will be collected at check-in and refunded at check-out (subject to actual consumption).
              </p>
